  "description": "Use the Flow Rollback Records element to undo DML inside the current transaction. Covers when rollback is appropriate vs catastrophic, how to combine with fault paths, partial-commit pitfalls, and the interaction with publish-after-commit. NOT for external-system rollback (use compensation patterns) \u2014 use apex/apex-savepoint-and-rollback.",
